{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1450364149,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1af0337bc826d543175bf569ac8c2f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you @calgarybride2015&amp;nbsp;@ashhtayy&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"krystalball\"]&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"]!!! &amp;nbsp;I love them!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"krystalball\"] omg don&#039;t worry! &amp;nbsp;I feel far behind too! &amp;nbsp;I feel like even if we are on top of things we will feel like there is always something left to do! &amp;nbsp;We were planning to look at bands over the Christmas break but I saw this on an extended cyber Monday sale and grabbed it while I could.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] haha I definitely didn&#039;t want to take it off! &amp;nbsp;I wore it for bit, took a couple pictures, then took it off before Colin got home... then put it back on when he came home because he wanted to see it... lol eventually I put it away, but now I feel like my finger is missing something lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I woke up so excited this morning! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to start working on my centrepieces, I have this vision in my head... hopefully it works out, I will of course post pics! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to work on a logo for our beach bags, my girlfriend works in textiles and might be able to sort something out for us :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908437,"PostDate":1450364017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you @calgarybride2015\u00a0@ashhtayy\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281820\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281820-krystalball\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">krystalball<\/span><\/a>\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a>!!! \u00a0I love them!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281820\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281820-krystalball\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">krystalball<\/span><\/a> omg don't worry! \u00a0I feel far behind too! \u00a0I feel like even if we are on top of things we will feel like there is always something left to do! \u00a0We were planning to look at bands over the Christmas break but I saw this on an extended cyber Monday sale and grabbed it while I could.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> haha I definitely didn't want to take it off! \u00a0I wore it for bit, took a couple pictures, then took it off before Colin got home... then put it back on when he came home because he wanted to see it... lol eventually I put it away, but now I feel like my finger is missing something lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I woke up so excited this morning! \u00a0I'm going to start working on my centrepieces, I have this vision in my head... hopefully it works out, I will of course post pics! \u00a0I'm going to work on a logo for our beach bags, my girlfriend works in textiles and might be able to sort something out for us <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f353231c559684ace8f094e22f58de4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Your wedding band is so pretty!! I did the same thing when I got mine as well lol. It&#039;s so nice to have them all on now after the wedding. My finger is definitely flashier now!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Love the silver ribbon :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908592,"PostDate":1450804802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your wedding band is so pretty!! I did the same thing when I got mine as well lol. It's so nice to have them all on now after the wedding. My finger is definitely flashier now!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love the silver ribbon <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1450804904,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d665a73403e70e13ae493213cf527a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] Thank you for stopping by my thread - I am so in love with my ring, Col caught me with it on on the weekend again lol! &amp;nbsp;It wouldn&#039;t feel right to do this all without you&amp;nbsp; ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908593,"PostDate":1450804879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Thank you for stopping by my thread - I am so in love with my ring, Col caught me with it on on the weekend again lol! \u00a0It wouldn't feel right to do this all without you\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.132.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1451614257,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"220b98fa89d566d484a0720567f414b4","RawContent":"Hi everyone! I hope you all had a great Christmas!!!\n\n\nWhile waiting for my friends to arrive I wanted to take a minute to update my thread - we have been so productive this Christmas break!!!\n\n\nWe took advantage of the Boxing Day sales and purchased our groomsmen gifts:\n\n\n\n\n\nWe ordered Colin&#039;s wedding band, should arrive any day now:\n\n\n\n\n\nWe ordered table numbers, will be painting these a sparkly metallic silver and working on pairing with a vase of flowers. They are 5 1\/2 inches tall:\n\n\n\n\n\nAnd after visiting about 6 stores in 3 days, we found our suits!\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSo handsome :)\n\n\nWe will pick up the groomsmen&#039;s suits before Col&#039;s mom heads home back to London after my shower in February so she can bring them to the guys and they can have them tailored there. Col will be going in March to have his tailored before the wedding as he hopes to drop a size or two. We&#039;ve both been in the gym every day since the 23rd of December so if we keep this up we should be good :)\n\n\nThat&#039;s all for now!\n\n\nI hope you all have a wonderful New Years and 2016 is even better than this last amazing year has been! Xoxo\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908810,"PostDate":1451614085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! I hope you all had a great Christmas!!!<br><br>\nWhile waiting for my friends to arrive I wanted to take a minute to update my thread - we have been so productive this Christmas break!!!<br><br>\nWe took advantage of the Boxing Day sales and purchased our groomsmen gifts:<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908810]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161008356.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610083.170812.jpg -  96.8KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161008356.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610083.170812.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nWe ordered Colin's wedding band, should arrive any day now:<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908810]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161011379.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610113.458647.jpg -  36.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161011379.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610113.458647.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nWe ordered table numbers, will be painting these a sparkly metallic silver and working on pairing with a vase of flowers. They are 5 1\/2 inches tall:<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908810]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161017578.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610175.373370.jpg -  115.63KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161017578.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610175.373370.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nAnd after visiting about 6 stores in 3 days, we found our suits!<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908810]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161021396.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610213.576049.jpg -  109.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161021396.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610213.576049.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908810]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161022331.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610222.897965.jpg -  105.12KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281751-145161022331.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1451610222.897965.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br>\nSo handsome <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nWe will pick up the groomsmen's suits before Col's mom heads home back to London after my shower in February so she can bring them to the guys and they can have them tailored there. Col will be going in March to have his tailored before the wedding as he hopes to drop a size or two. We've both been in the gym every day since the 23rd of December so if we keep this up we should be good <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nThat's all for now!<br><br>\nI hope you all have a wonderful New Years and 2016 is even better than this last amazing year has been! Xoxo<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.49.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04ea28785d00a4083bdea91d144693a1","RawContent":"Happy New Year, @[member=\"deecol\"]!\n\n\nLooks like you had a very successful Christmas break. I imagine the guys will love those watches. Such a generous gift. Col&#039;s band is perfect and so is that suit. Love it!\n\n\nYour wedding is only about a month before ours. Time for us to kick it up a notch and cross some of these big items off our list. \n\n\nHope you had a great night!","Attachments":[],"Id":1908811,"PostDate":1451674148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Happy New Year, @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a>!<br><br>\nLooks like you had a very successful Christmas break. I imagine the guys will love those watches. Such a generous gift. Col's band is perfect and so is that suit. Love it!<br><br>\nYour wedding is only about a month before ours. Time for us to kick it up a notch and cross some of these big items off our list. <br><br>\nHope you had a great night!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423108661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.132.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae756d7dd0532980c72783a42333571b","RawContent":"Happy new year to you too @[member=\"ashhtayy\"]!!!\n\n\nThanks! I can&#039;t believe all the progress we made over this break! Still have a bunch more to do but nice to have some of the bigger things taken care of!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908813,"PostDate":1451687507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Happy new year to you too @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a>!!!<br><br>\nThanks! I can't believe all the progress we made over this break! Still have a bunch more to do but nice to have some of the bigger things taken care of!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d94fbb22b7bf88c59782e1ce9f21b1e1","RawContent":"Happy New Year Dee!! It&#039;s gonna be such am exciting year for all of us :)\n\n\nI see you&#039;ve been busy and productive during the holiday break. Great finds, the watches are really sharp. Your groomsmen will really like them.\n\n\nCol&#039;s ring looks great and his suit looks great on him. He&#039;s looking quite debonair in that outfit\n\n\nAnd your table numbers are a great find. Are they pretty lightweight?\n\n\nCan&#039;t wait to see what else you&#039;re planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1908867,"PostDate":1451799832,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Happy New Year Dee!! It's gonna be such am exciting year for all of us <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI see you've been busy and productive during the holiday break. Great finds, the watches are really sharp. Your groomsmen will really like them.<br><br>\nCol's ring looks great and his suit looks great on him. He's looking quite debonair in that outfit<br><br>\nAnd your table numbers are a great find. Are they pretty lightweight?<br><br>\nCan't wait to see what else you're planning\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.132.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7db7940c790f8fbf3152cd16ea0992c6","RawContent":"Thanks @[member=\"Wafflesmom\"]! Happy new year to you too! 2016 is going to be the best year yet!!!\n\n\nCol won&#039;t let me show anyone what he looks like in the suit, I told him I was going to share with the bdw ladies and he was okay with that lol [emoji4] I can&#039;t wait for his ring to arrive. He wants to get it engraved with our wedding date.  I really think the guys will love the watches too! And we got such a great deal - yay for Boxing Day sales!\n\n\nThe table numbers are super light weight! I got them from stockade.com and they ship within Canada. They come separately as numbers and bases and they advise painting them once they are all assembled but I don&#039;t want to risk them breaking in our suitcases so we&#039;re going to paint separately and assemble in Mexico. I think they&#039;re going to look so pretty, I can&#039;t wait to get them painted and get the rest of the centrepieces.\n\n\nYou are soooo close! You must be getting so excited!!! I&#039;m so excited for you :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908869,"PostDate":1451800332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a>! Happy new year to you too! 2016 is going to be the best year yet!!!<br><br>\nCol won't let me show anyone what he looks like in the suit, I told him I was going to share with the bdw ladies and he was okay with that lol [emoji4] I can't wait for his ring to arrive. He wants to get it engraved with our wedding date.  I really think the guys will love the watches too! And we got such a great deal - yay for Boxing Day sales!<br><br>\nThe table numbers are super light weight! I got them from stockade.com and they ship within Canada. They come separately as numbers and bases and they advise painting them once they are all assembled but I don't want to risk them breaking in our suitcases so we're going to paint separately and assemble in Mexico. I think they're going to look so pretty, I can't wait to get them painted and get the rest of the centrepieces.<br><br>\nYou are soooo close! You must be getting so excited!!! I'm so excited for you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"S