{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e7bd022dc58a0a62acd64c9ce2b950d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1909421\" timestamp=\"1452743018\"]\n@[member=\"deecol\"]  I love it and totally agree with @[member=\"perianjay\"] - it has sentimental meaning. Me too - I say go for it. Doug bought me the palm tree for my bracelt as an anniversary gift and gave it to me in Mexico so definitely something like this would really be special![\/quote]Awe that&#039;s great.  Love the choices. For my birthday before the wedding Shawn got me the Mexico one!  For our wedding he got me &#039;forever together&#039; although he had already gotten me it (haha) so I got a heart one as none of the wedding ones really drew me in. Still hoping to find one :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909422,"PostDate":1452746819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 13 January 2016 - 08:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a>  I love it and totally agree with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> - it has sentimental meaning. Me too - I say go for it. Doug bought me the palm tree for my bracelt as an anniversary gift and gave it to me in Mexico so definitely something like this would really be special!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nAwe that's great.  Love the choices. For my birthday before the wedding Shawn got me the Mexico one!  For our wedding he got me 'forever together' although he had already gotten me it (haha) so I got a heart one as none of the wedding ones really drew me in. Still hoping to find one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f13b05c624fbb84ac137bd1d0ddcb3e7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1909422\" timestamp=\"1452743219\"]\nAwe that&#039;s great. Love the choices. For my birthday before the wedding Shawn got me the Mexico one! For our wedding he got me &#039;forever together&#039; although he had already gotten me it (haha) so I got a heart one as none of the wedding ones really drew me in. Still hoping to find one :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nWhat&#039;s this??? There&#039;s a Mexico charm from Pandora???? Do you have a pic? I swear i&#039;ve been through their website I don&#039;t know how many times.... and I&#039;ve never seen it!!! I love the palm tree. It looks nice on the bracelet. I already have the \"Love\" charm and the pink heart from the special last Valentine&#039;s Day but now I&#039;m going to look for the \"Together Forever\" one. Geez..... how do I miss this stuff?????","Attachments":[],"Id":1909426,"PostDate":1452747327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 13 January 2016 - 08:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Awe that's great. Love the choices. For my birthday before the wedding Shawn got me the Mexico one! For our wedding he got me 'forever together' although he had already gotten me it (haha) so I got a heart one as none of the wedding ones really drew me in. Still hoping to find one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What's this??? There's a Mexico charm from Pandora???? Do you have a pic? I swear i've been through their website I don't know how many times.... and I've never seen it!!! I love the palm tree. It looks nice on the bracelet. I already have the \"Love\" charm and the pink heart from the special last Valentine's Day but now I'm going to look for the \"Together Forever\" one. Geez..... how do I miss this stuff?????<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1452747956,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a84e292c03cdb47afb48f7b657a4e2f8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1909426\" timestamp=\"1452743727\"]\nWhat&#039;s this??? There&#039;s a Mexico charm from Pandora???? Do you have a pic? I swear i&#039;ve been through their website I don&#039;t know how many times.... and I&#039;ve never seen it!!! I love the palm tree. It looks nice on the bracelet. I already have the \"Love\" charm and the pink heart from the special last Valentine&#039;s Day but now I&#039;m going to look for the \"Together Forever\" one. Geez..... how do I miss this stuff?????[\/quote]I got the Mexico charm (dangles) and together forever back in 2014. They are def still on their website.\n\nI also have the dangle love charm with pink stone -- same as yours?\n\nI&#039;ll post a pic\nAnd sorry for hijacking :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909427,"PostDate":1452747736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 13 January 2016 - 08:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<p>What's this??? There's a Mexico charm from Pandora???? Do you have a pic? I swear i've been through their website I don't know how many times.... and I've never seen it!!! I love the palm tree. It looks nice on the bracelet. I already have the \"Love\" charm and the pink heart from the special last Valentine's Day but now I'm going to look for the \"Together Forever\" one. Geez..... how do I miss this stuff?????<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I got the Mexico charm (dangles) and together forever back in 2014. They are def still on their website.<br><br>\nI also have the dangle love charm with pink stone -- same as yours?<br><br>\nI'll post a pic<br>\nAnd sorry for hijacking <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909427]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-277873-145274408887.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744083.183434.jpg -  249.36KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-277873-145274408887.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744083.183434.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909427]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-277873-145274423046.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744223.804622.jpg -  279.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-277873-145274423046.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744223.804622.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7666e45140cd6a5828ca7ea1aa68387b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1909427\" timestamp=\"1452744136\"]\nI got the Mexico charm (dangles) and together forever back in 2014. They are def still on their website.\n\nI also have the dangle love charm with pink stone -- same as yours?\n\nI&#039;ll post a pic\nAnd sorry for hijacking :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=34704\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744083.183434.jpg[\/url]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=34706\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744223.804622.jpg[\/url]\n[\/quote]\nHa ha! I just added the Mexico charm to my wish list!! I swear I&#039;ve never seen it before and don&#039;t know how I missed it! Ok so you have the Together Forever scroll charm. I like it. I found that one and then the little heart that says you and me. Yep - I have the same pink \"Love\" plus I also have the pave crystal love one and the matching heart. My bracelet is getting too heavy now. I told Doug I&#039;m almost ready to start a second one... He wanted to know why! lol\n\nMe too @deecol  Sorry for hijacking....","Attachments":[],"Id":1909431,"PostDate":1452751367,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 13 January 2016 - 09:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I got the Mexico charm (dangles) and together forever back in 2014. They are def still on their website.<br><br>\nI also have the dangle love charm with pink stone -- same as yours?<br><br>\nI'll post a pic<br>\nAnd sorry for hijacking <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=34704' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744083.183434.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=34706' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1452744223.804622.jpg<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ha ha! I just added the Mexico charm to my wish list!! I swear I've never seen it before and don't know how I missed it! Ok so you have the Together Forever scroll charm. I like it. I found that one and then the little heart that says you and me. Yep - I have the same pink \"Love\" plus I also have the pave crystal love one and the matching heart. My bracelet is getting too heavy now. I told Doug I'm almost ready to start a second one... He wanted to know why! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Me too @deecol\u00a0 Sorry for hijacking....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e099972f3e31e67f4eadbc4c15b32525","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1909431\" timestamp=\"1452747767\"]\nHa ha! I just added the Mexico charm to my wish list!! I swear I&#039;ve never seen it before and don&#039;t know how I missed it! Ok so you have the Together Forever scroll charm. I like it. I found that one and then the little heart that says you and me. Yep - I have the same pink \"Love\" plus I also have the pave crystal love one and the matching heart. My bracelet is getting too heavy now. I told Doug I&#039;m almost ready to start a second one... He wanted to know why! lol\n\nMe too @[member=\"deecol\"]  Sorry for hijacking....[\/quote]Ohhh I&#039;ll check out the &#039;you and me&#039; one. And the others you mentioned you had. I&#039;m eying up the dangly wedding ring but at $140 just not sure. \n\nMy original is basically full (can maybe fit one or two more depending on size) I have a few more of the &#039;glass&#039; colored charms and dice from Vegas you can&#039;t see on that one. So I can work to fill the bangle!! Hehe They didn&#039;t have the bangle when I got mine so was excited Shawn got me it :). And come on Doug, women love their charms!! \n\nI love Pandora.  \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909434,"PostDate":1452751880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 13 January 2016 - 10:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Ha ha! I just added the Mexico charm to my wish list!! I swear I've never seen it before and don't know how I missed it! Ok so you have the Together Forever scroll charm. I like it. I found that one and then the little heart that says you and me. Yep - I have the same pink \"Love\" plus I also have the pave crystal love one and the matching heart. My bracelet is getting too heavy now. I told Doug I'm almost ready to start a second one... He wanted to know why! lol<br><br>\nMe too @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a>  Sorry for hijacking....<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nOhhh I'll check out the 'you and me' one. And the others you mentioned you had. I'm eying up the dangly wedding ring but at $140 just not sure. <br><br>\nMy original is basically full (can maybe fit one or two more depending on size) I have a few more of the 'glass' colored charms and dice from Vegas you can't see on that one. So I can work to fill the bangle!! Hehe They didn't have the bangle when I got mine so was excited Shawn got me it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. And come on Doug, women love their charms!! <br><br>\nI love Pandora.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1461b9f277457bf65ecb81e7eaf7f9db","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1909434\" timestamp=\"1452748280\"]\nOhhh I&#039;ll check out the &#039;you and me&#039; one. And the others you mentioned you had. I&#039;m eying up the dangly wedding ring but at $140 just not sure.\n\nMy original is basically full (can maybe fit one or two more depending on size) I have a few more of the &#039;glass&#039; colored charms and dice from Vegas you can&#039;t see on that one. So I can work to fill the bangle!! Hehe They didn&#039;t have the bangle when I got mine so was excited Shawn got me it :). And come on Doug, women love their charms!!\n\nI love Pandora.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nOh Vegas dice! That&#039;s cool! I also saw the passport. That would be neat to add. Yeah - I love Pandora too. I&#039;ll take a pic of mine tomorrow and add it on your own thread since we&#039;ve effectively hijacked Dee&#039;s lol I can&#039;t wear the bangle style. It&#039;s just too uncomfortable on my wrist. It&#039;s what my sister originally got me but I swapped it out for the serpentine instead and the next one I want the lobster claw clasp. I find the one I have is so hard to open and close. I got the little chain and added it because every time I opened it everything would go flying off. I tried stoppers right at the clasp and they were uncomfortable. The chain isn&#039;t much better but at least when I take it off everything doesn&#039;t go flying all over the floor!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909445,"PostDate":1452758921,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 13 January 2016 - 10:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ohhh I'll check out the 'you and me' one. And the others you mentioned you had. I'm eying up the dangly wedding ring but at $140 just not sure.<br><br>\nMy original is basically full (can maybe fit one or two more depending on size) I have a few more of the 'glass' colored charms and dice from Vegas you can't see on that one. So I can work to fill the bangle!! Hehe They didn't have the bangle when I got mine so was excited Shawn got me it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. And come on Doug, women love their charms!!<br><br>\nI love Pandora.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh Vegas dice! That's cool! I also saw the passport. That would be neat to add. Yeah - I love Pandora too. I'll take a pic of mine tomorrow and add it on your own thread since we've effectively hijacked Dee's lol I can't wear the bangle style. It's just too uncomfortable on my wrist. It's what my sister originally got me but I swapped it out for the serpentine instead and the next one I want the lobster claw clasp. I find the one I have is so hard to open and close. I got the little chain and added it because every time I opened it everything would go flying off. I tried stoppers right at the clasp and they were uncomfortable. The chain isn't much better but at least when I take it off everything doesn't go flying all over the floor!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8ca194b77d6afa054f251d3653b02c4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;haha&amp;nbsp;@acw271011&amp;nbsp;@calgarybride2015 you did not hijack the thread! &amp;nbsp;Anyone looking for Pandora charm ideas hit the jackpot if they stumble upon this lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;mon Doug! &amp;nbsp;When someone has a Pandora bracelet, your gift giving problems are solved for a couple years! &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s all I&#039;ve been getting my sister for the past two years!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909451,"PostDate":1452781162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>haha\u00a0@acw271011\u00a0@calgarybride2015 you did not hijack the thread! \u00a0Anyone looking for Pandora charm ideas hit the jackpot if they stumble upon this lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>C'mon Doug! \u00a0When someone has a Pandora bracelet, your gift giving problems are solved for a couple years! \u00a0It's all I've been getting my sister for the past two years!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.190.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"babd8d4a0ca608231ea721ecf45a7f63","RawContent":"@[member=\"deecol\"]  I know right? It makes things SO easy!!  I&#039;m waiting to see what they&#039;re bringing out for Valentines Day this year.... should be soon so that I can drop hints!!\n\n\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909472,"PostDate":1452796370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a>  I know right? It makes things SO easy!!  I'm waiting to see what they're bringing out for Valentines Day this year.... should be soon so that I can drop hints!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f55fc5d7aa64a88569058c2954e3635","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] I just got an email about Pandora&#039;s new Valentine&#039;s Day collection! &amp;nbsp;How do we get this to land in Doug&#039;s email inbox? lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909553,"PostDate":1452872422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> I just got an email about Pandora's new Valentine's Day collection! \u00a0How do we get this to land in Doug's email inbox? lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"212352e231b2295d122362f085ca9ca8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"deecol\" post=\"1909553\" timestamp=\"1452868822\"]\n@[member=\"acw271011\"] I just got an email about Pandora&#039;s new Valentine&#039;s Day collection!  How do we get this to land in Doug&#039;s email inbox? lol[\/quote]\nYep - I got it too!! Ha ha I don&#039;t need to worry about the email. I just take what I like and add it to my wish list, then tell him the \"whatever\" occasion charm is on my wish list. Makes it so easy!! No aggro for him and I get what I want! Simple!! lol now to help him understand WHY I need another bracelet!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909564,"PostDate":1452881534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>deecol, on 15 January 2016 - 07:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> I just got an email about Pandora's new Valentine's Day collection! \u00a0How do we get this to land in Doug's email inbox? lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYep - I got it too!! Ha ha I don't need to worry about the email. I just take what I like and add it to my wish list, then tell him the \"whatever\" occasion charm is on my wish list. Makes it so easy!! No aggro for him and I get what I want! Simple!! lol now to help him understand WHY I need another bracelet!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":345,"TotalPages":35,"CurrentPage":190,"NextPage":200,"PreviousPage":180,"LastPage":340},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
