ght.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/> For the guest book, we are doing a mad libs card, which I plan to scan and make into a photo book. Here is a pic of the card:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417453045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.169.78.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce6ca72e779fa98970e5cc67308fbf7c","RawContent":"@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] - how am I doing? Am I very far behind?\n\n\nThanks for the guestbook idea, it&#039;s super cute! We&#039;re leaning more towards not having one, unless I find something that I feel I cannot live without! Lol\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1911594,"PostDate":1457197807,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> - how am I doing? Am I very far behind?<br><br>\nThanks for the guestbook idea, it's super cute! We're leaning more towards not having one, unless I find something that I feel I cannot live without! Lol<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58e01ce566b44f3eab973d750e7d61dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"] I don&#039;t think you are far behind at all! A lot of this stuff I&#039;ve only recently done or haven&#039;t done yet. Here are a few things that I&#039;ve either recently thought of or I didn&#039;t notice on your list, in case they should be:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Get summer clothes out, wash them, etc. I&#039;m also going to take Jeff&#039;s wedding attire to the dry cleaner. His is very casual but it&#039;s brand new, never washed, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Do you have your playlist done?&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Your vows?&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Photography shot list - to make sure you capture all the groupings, etc. that you want. I think it&#039;s easy to miss some in the excitement of the day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911597,"PostDate":1457198583,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> I don't think you are far behind at all! A lot of this stuff I've only recently done or haven't done yet. Here are a few things that I've either recently thought of or I didn't notice on your list, in case they should be:<\/p>\n<ul><li>Get summer clothes out, wash them, etc. I'm also going to take Jeff's wedding attire to the dry cleaner. His is very casual but it's brand new, never washed, etc.\u00a0<\/li>\n<li>Do you have your playlist done?<\/li>\n<li>Your vows?<\/li>\n<li>Photography shot list - to make sure you capture all the groupings, etc. that you want. I think it's easy to miss some in the excitement of the day.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417453045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.14.92.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f9c4e8c6e86f19387e2f10d8d40c265","RawContent":"@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] I&#039;ve actually ticked a couple things off since I last posted but will do one big update soon. I&#039;m at a bachelorette this weekend (not my own).\n\n\nThanks for posting a few things! You girls are the best! Here&#039;s where I am with those items:\n\n\n- summer clothes: I&#039;m going to be buying a lot lol but thank you for the reminder to wash any I&#039;m bringing\n\n- playlist we are about 75% done with picking songs, need to load on the app when we&#039;ve picked everything, think I mentioned this one. The next two weekends we are hoping to get a ton done. \n\n- vows, we aren&#039;t doing personal vows. We both just sort of decided from the get-go that we wouldn&#039;t do them. \n\n- I&#039;m printing pictures and making a list for the photographer that we&#039;ll go over in our meeting before the wedding, think I mentioned this one too\n\n\nThank you again, and anything else you remember please feel free to send my way! You are soooo close now!!! Just over a month!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1911599,"PostDate":1457200105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> I've actually ticked a couple things off since I last posted but will do one big update soon. I'm at a bachelorette this weekend (not my own).<br><br>\nThanks for posting a few things! You girls are the best! Here's where I am with those items:<br><br>\n- summer clothes: I'm going to be buying a lot lol but thank you for the reminder to wash any I'm bringing<br>\n- playlist we are about 75% done with picking songs, need to load on the app when we've picked everything, think I mentioned this one. The next two weekends we are hoping to get a ton done. <br>\n- vows, we aren't doing personal vows. We both just sort of decided from the get-go that we wouldn't do them. <br>\n- I'm printing pictures and making a list for the photographer that we'll go over in our meeting before the wedding, think I mentioned this one too<br><br>\nThank you again, and anything else you remember please feel free to send my way! You are soooo close now!!! Just over a month!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.141.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1458009609,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cb2b2f32087d1151f7066894f77ed4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;It&#039;s been a couple of weeks since I posted my to-do list. My attention has been off of myself lately and more on my best friend. &amp;nbsp;She was supposed to get married April 2nd, I was her maid of honour... a week ago she got a knock on the door from a girl that her fianc\u00e9 has been having a relationship with for a year... needless to day she is broken and devastated, the wedding is off of course, and I don&#039;t want to even mention anything about my wedding to her right now while she&#039;s dealing with this. &amp;nbsp;She may\/may not come to Mexico, which I will of course understand and support either way, I just hope she lets me know soon as she is on my marriage application and I would need to ask someone else to step in and make sure her dress fits them, but she can&#039;t face making a decision right now...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;While a couple of things have been added to my to-do list, we have definitely crossed some items off too:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Complete:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Dress alterations (corset added)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Chose processional, father-daughter dance, first dance (will post when the rest are chosen)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Picked up beach bags from Total Advantage&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Cake Topper&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Passport renewed (I was a couple weeks shy of the 6 month validity period)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Bridal Party gifts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Groomsmens suits sent back with Colin&#039;s Mom to England for the guys to have altered&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Wedding wishes and marriage application sent to WC&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Downloaded Wedding DJ App and WedPics App&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Confirmed reception details with WC - dinner from 6-9pm at the Hibiscus Pool, extend until 11pm&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Made nail, pedi, &amp;amp; waxing appointments for the Thursday and Friday before we leave - we leave on a Saturday morning&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;To Do:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Receive the remaining 40 beach bags and waterproof phone cases&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Colin&#039;s suit alterations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;picking up his altered suit this weekend along with a dress shirt&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Card Box\/Cage \u2013 &lt;strong&gt;I found the box I want to use, need to turn it into a \u201ccard box\u201d&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Find cheap paper fans for chairs at ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Engrave Col&#039;s wedding band, and see if they could do mine (might be too thin?) &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 going to the engravers on Sunday&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Choose recessional song &amp;amp; document signing songs (2) and the rest of the dinner\/reception playlist and download to app &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 We have chosen all our music, may just need to change the father\/daughter dance to a joint bride\/father-groom\/mother dance, Col needs to ask his mom if she wants to have a dance.&amp;nbsp; Other than that, everything is chosen and needs to be downloaded and loaded onto the app&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Bridal Party Entrance:&amp;nbsp; \u201cSomewhere Over the Rainbow\u201d - &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(84,84,84);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Israel Kamakawiwo&#039;ole&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Bride Entrance: \u201cA Thousand Years\u201d \u2013 Christina Perri&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Document Signing:&amp;nbsp; \u201cMarry You\u201d \u2013 Bruno Mars &amp;amp; \u201cI Do\u201d \u2013 Colbie Caillat&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Recessional (this was all Col and I love it!):&amp;nbsp; \u201cHigher &amp;amp; Higher\u201d \u2013 Jackie Wilson&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;First Dance:&amp;nbsp; \u201cThinking Out Loud\u201d \u2013 Ed Sheeran&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Father\/Daughter Dance (If isn\u2019t changed to a joint Mother\/Son Dance): \u201cI\u2019ll Always be your Baby\u201d \u2013 Natalie Grant&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Exchange currency, the dollar has been creeping up slowly so we might start now&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Finish welcome letter, I spy and signage for beach, I want to have a sign that says \"Choose a Seat Not a Side\" or something along those lines, but worry about where to put it... this is TBD. &amp;nbsp;I worked the \"weekly itinerary\" text into the welcome letter, I&#039;ll post a photo once these are finished&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Buy a selfie stick for the go-pro, an external iPhone charger, and batteries for the walkie talkies Col has from his Lake Louise snowboarding days, I think the wi-fi situation there is primarily in the lobby and only for an hour so these will really come in handy, especially on the wedding day so we don&#039;t bump into each other&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Confirm photo package with the photography company one month before. &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 Col won.&amp;nbsp; We agreed on the package with less photos\u2026 we still get 4 hours coverage with 110 photos but even I couldn\u2019t justify an extra $350USD for 1 extra hour and 20 more photos, I need to email the photographers and confirm this weekend&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;We might scrap the guestbook idea altogether, I picked up a feather pen from Michael&#039;s a couple months ago during one of their sales but haven&#039;t decided what to do, so we may not do anything at all... again TBD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 We decided to scrap this. If something that blows our minds comes along we may reconsider but for now it\u2019s a no-go.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Paint our table numbers&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 Col painted these while I was away at my best friend\u2019s bachelorette (the weekend before she got the bad news :(&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;) We bought both a champagne silver paint and silver glitter, once he did the silver only he left it for me to see and we both loved how it looked and thought the glitter would be too much&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Make a binder of correspondence with the resort&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Ring box\/bag &lt;strong&gt;\u2013working on it, we have an idea, stay tuned lol&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Timeline &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 Col was actually super cute about this, I couldn\u2019t stop laughing.&amp;nbsp; I guess they do things in a slightly different order in the UK than we do in Canada and he was actually freaking out (in a hilarious way) and \u201ccouldn\u2019t have it\u201d because it didn\u2019t \u201cfeel like a real wedding that way\u201d.&amp;nbsp; I\u2019ve never seen or heard of a Groom-to-be so involved in this and it just cracked me right up, so with some minor tweaks, and a very slight compromise from his end, our timeline for our wedding day will be:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;12pm-3pm Lunch &amp;amp; Getting Ready (earlier for me), we will have walkie talkies to ensure we don\u2019t bump into each other at lunch, or I may just order room service&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;4pm Ceremony @ Tulum Beachfront, followed by&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Toast and Group Photo&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Guests can head to their rooms to freshen up or to the bar at the Coba resort (closer to the reception)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Bridal Party &amp;amp; Parents Photos&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Dee &amp;amp; Col Photos \u2013 2 locations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;6pm Dinner &amp;amp; Reception to start at the Coba Hibiscus pool&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Once everyone is seated, MC announce parents &amp;amp; wedding party&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;MC announce new Mr &amp;amp; Mrs&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Bride\u2019s father to make a toast before dinner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Dinner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Bride &amp;amp; Groom thank-yous&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Best Man speech &amp;amp; Maid of Honour Speech&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Cake Cutting&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;First Dance \u2013 Bride &amp;amp; Groom&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Father\/Daughter &amp;amp; Mother\/Son Dance (TBC \u2013 Mother\/Son Dance)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;PARTY&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;11pm Reception ends, anyone else who wants to continue the party will head to the disco&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;MC Script &lt;strong&gt;- Finalizing&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Thank you speeches&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Seating Chart &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;\u2013 this was a tough one, my parents are divorced and will not sit at the same table\u2026 I only have 5 tables so I didn\u2019t have many options.&amp;nbsp; I figured it out in the end and it all works out really well.&amp;nbsp; We have 5 (possibly 7 \u2026 yay for slackers\u2026) more people still booking so we worked them into the seating plan just incase.&amp;nbsp; We are working on a way to display this, but it will have to be a last minute thing to accomodate any changes&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Shopping with my sister in a couple of weeks and planning to get &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Buy a second white dress to change into during the reception if I get uncomfortable&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Outfit for the bachelorette &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;A blue garter - we&#039;re not doing a bouquet toss or the garter thing but I wanted to wear one anyway, and some lingerie&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Buy chicken cutlet\/sticky boob things (I&#039;m sure I nailed the terminology) for my dress&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Clothes for dinners etc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Figure out vase situation for the centrepeices - I&#039;ve asked the WC to send a picture of what they were going to rent us, we may just buy 3 more from the dollar store and bring those&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Send out email to guests regarding wedding day attire &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Sent this out and included:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Wedding Day Attire info&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Important Dates: bachelor &amp;amp; bachelorette parties and wedding day timing&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;\u201cDon\u2019t forget to pack\u2026\u201d&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Info about Riviera Maya (Average temp in April and TimeZone)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Other important things to remember (travel insurance, vaccines\/shots, credit card, drinking the water in Mexico etc)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Reminder of our hashtag and our ID for the WedPics app&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Hair Trial &lt;strong&gt;\u2013 my girlfriend (also my hairdresser and is coming to the wedding) is coming over in a couple weeks when Col isn\u2019t home to try out my hair styles, we also dying my hair the Tuesday before we leave for Mexico&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Book eyelash extension appt&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Continue tanning, started the week before my shower and starting again this week &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;\u2013 started tanning again, only once a week, I tend to get dark really fast&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:30pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;\u00b7&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Ties&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Added to Checklist:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;\u00b7\t\t &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Groom\u2019s Gift - I want to do something special for Colin on our day and have something delivered to him, like a message with a gift or something but I haven\u2019t figured out what yet&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;\u00b7\t\t &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Centrepieces \u2013 while we were going to just figure out vases and use the aisle flowers, we decided to take it into our own hands and I am so glad we did!&amp;nbsp; We will now use my bouquet included in the package, split into 6 smaller bunches and used only in the aisles.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;I wish I could take credit but these premade bunches were at Michael\u2019s and I fell in love, and took advantage of the 40% of floral sale plus 20% off the entire purchase coupon.&amp;nbsp; I found these adorable heart shaped vases at Michael\u2019s as well.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I completely forgot to post my shoes for the reception months and months ago. &amp;nbsp;They are nothing fancy, but comfy, cute and were $15 at payless. &amp;nbsp;I love that they have a strap at the back so I don&#039;t have to risk them falling off, and they will be hidden under my dress anyway.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also completely forgot that I bought these in September (was possibly going to use them for my shower). &amp;nbsp;They are the cutest little bottles of bubbles from Party City. &amp;nbsp;I bought 2 boxes (12 in each) and am thinking about either putting them on a random chairs for the ceremony or a few bottles on each table at the reception. &amp;nbsp;They are about the size of my finger:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As I was typing another one of Colin&#039;s friend&#039;s and girlfriend booked. &amp;nbsp;That brings us to 51 people - 49 adults (including Colin and I) and 2 children.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m sure I\u2019m forgetting something but that\u2019s all I can think of for now&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; My bullets are all off the and OCD in me hates that I can&#039;t get them lined up lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911882,"PostDate":1458008662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">It's been a couple of weeks since I posted my to-do list. My attention has been off of myself lately and more on my best friend. \u00a0She was supposed to get married April 2nd, I was her maid of honour... a week ago she got a knock on the door from a girl that her fianc\u00e9 has been having a relationship with for a year... needless to day she is broken and devastated, the wedding is off of course, and I don't want to even mention anything about my wedding to her right now while she's dealing with this. \u00a0She may\/may not come to Mexico, which I will of course understand and support either way, I just hope she lets me know soon as she is on my marriage application and I would need to ask someone else to step in and make sure her dress fits them, but she can't face making a decision right now...\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">While a couple of things have been added to my to-do list, we have definitely crossed some items off too:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Complete:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Dress alterations (corset added)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Chose processional, father-daughter dance, first dance (will post when the rest are chosen)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Picked up beach bags from Total Advantage<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Cake Topper<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Passport renewed (I was a couple weeks shy of the 6 month validity period)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Bridal Party gifts<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Groomsmens suits sent back with Colin's Mom to England for the guys to have altered<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Wedding wishes and marriage application sent to WC<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Downloaded Wedding DJ App and WedPics App<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Confirmed reception details with WC - dinner from 6-9pm at the Hibiscus Pool, extend until 11pm<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Made nail, pedi, & waxing appointments for the Thursday and Friday before we leave - we leave on a Saturday morning<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">To Do:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Receive the remaining 40 beach bags and waterproof phone cases<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Colin's suit alterations<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"> <strong>picking up his altered suit this weekend along with a dress shirt<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Card Box\/Cage \u2013 <strong>I found the box I want to use, need to turn it into a \u201ccard box\u201d<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Find cheap paper fans for chairs at ceremony<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Engrave Col's wedding band, and see if they could do mine (might be too thin?) <strong>\u2013 going to the engravers on Sunday<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Choose recessional song & document signing songs (2) and the rest of the dinner\/reception playlist and download to app <strong>\u2013 We have chosen all our music, may just need to change the father\/daughter dance to a joint bride\/father-groom\/mother dance, Col needs to ask his mom if she wants to have a dance.\u00a0 Other than that, everything is chosen and needs to be downloaded and loaded onto the app<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Bridal Party Entrance:\u00a0 \u201cSomewhere Over the Rainbow\u201d - <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(84,84,84)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Israel Kamakawiwo'ole<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Bride Entrance: \u201cA Thousand Years\u201d \u2013 Christina Perri<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Document Signing:\u00a0 \u201cMarry You\u201d \u2013 Bruno Mars & \u201cI Do\u201d \u2013 Colbie Caillat<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Recessional (this was all Col and I love it!):\u00a0 \u201cHigher & Higher\u201d \u2013 Jackie Wilson<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">First Dance:\u00a0 \u201cThinking Out Loud\u201d \u2013 Ed Sheeran<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Father\/Daughter Dance (If isn\u2019t changed to a joint Mother\/Son Dance): \u201cI\u2019ll Always be your Baby\u201d \u2013 Natalie Grant<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Exchange currency, the dollar has been creeping up slowly so we might start now<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Finish welcome letter, I spy and signage for beach, I want to have a sign that says \"Choose a Seat Not a Side\" or something along those lines, but worry about where to put it... this is TBD. \u00a0I worked the \"weekly itinerary\" text into the welcome letter, I'll post a photo once these are finished\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Buy a selfie stick for the go-pro, an external iPhone charger, and batteries for the walkie talkies Col has from his Lake Louise snowboarding days, I think the wi-fi situation there is primarily in the lobby and only for an hour so these will really come in handy, especially on the wedding day so we don't bump into each other<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Confirm photo package with the photography company one month before. <strong>\u2013 Col won.\u00a0 We agreed on the package with less photos\u2026 we still get 4 hours coverage with 110 photos but even I couldn\u2019t justify an extra $350USD for 1 extra hour and 20 more photos, I need to email the photographers and confirm this weekend<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">We might scrap the guestbook idea altogether, I picked up a feather pen from Michael's a couple months ago during one of their sales but haven't decided what to do, so we may not do anything at all... again TBD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"> <strong>\u2013 We decided to scrap this. If something that blows our minds comes along we may reconsider but for now it\u2019s a no-go.<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Paint our table numbers<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"> <strong>\u2013 Col painted these while I was away at my best friend\u2019s bachelorette (the weekend before she got the bad news <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">\u00a0) We bought both a champagne silver paint and silver glitter, once he did the silver only he left it for me to see and we both loved how it looked and thought the glitter would be too much<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Make a binder of correspondence with the resort<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Ring box\/bag <strong>\u2013working on it, we have an idea, stay tuned lol<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Timeline <strong>\u2013 Col was actually super cute about this, I couldn\u2019t stop laughing.\u00a0 I guess they do things in a slightly different order in the UK than we do in Canada and he was actually freaking out (in a hilarious way) and \u201ccouldn\u2019t have it\u201d because it didn\u2019t \u201cfeel like a real wedding that way\u201d.\u00a0 I\u2019ve never seen or heard of a Groom-to-be so involved in this and it just cracked me right up, so with some minor tweaks, and a very slight compromise from his end, our timeline for our wedding day will be:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">12pm-3pm Lunch & Getting Ready (earlier for me), we will have walkie talkies to ensure we don\u2019t bump into each other at lunch, or I may just order room service<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">4pm Ceremony @ Tulum Beachfront, followed by<\/span><\/span><\/strong>\n<ul><li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Toast and Group Photo<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Guests can head to their rooms to freshen up or to the bar at the Coba resort (closer to the reception)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Bridal Party & Parents Photos<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Dee & Col Photos \u2013 2 locations<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">6pm Dinner & Reception to start at the Coba Hibiscus pool<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Once everyone is seated, MC announce parents & wedding party<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">MC announce new Mr & Mrs<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Bride\u2019s father to make a toast before dinner<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Dinner<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Bride & Groom thank-yous<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Best Man speech & Maid of Honour Speech<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Cake Cutting<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">First Dance \u2013 Bride & Groom<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Father\/Daughter & Mother\/Son Dance (TBC \u2013 Mother\/Son Dance)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">PARTY<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">11pm Reception ends, anyone else who wants to continue the party will head to the disco<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">MC Script <strong>- Finalizing<\/strong> <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Thank you speeches<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Seating Chart <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">\u2013 this was a tough one, my parents are divorced and will not sit at the same table\u2026 I only have 5 tables so I didn\u2019t have many options.\u00a0 I figured it out in the end and it all works out really well.\u00a0 We have 5 (possibly 7 \u2026 yay for slackers\u2026) more people still booking so we worked them into the seating plan just incase.\u00a0 We are working on a way to display this, but it will have to be a last minute thing to accomodate any changes<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Shopping with my sister in a couple of weeks and planning to get <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Buy a second white dress to change into during the reception if I get uncomfortable<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Outfit for the bachelorette <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">A blue garter - we're not doing a bouquet toss or the garter thing but I wanted to wear one anyway, and some lingerie<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Buy chicken cutlet\/sticky boob things (I'm sure I nailed the terminology) for my dress<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Clothes for dinners etc <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Figure out vase situation for the centrepeices - I've asked the WC to send a picture of what they were going to rent us, we may just buy 3 more from the dollar store and bring those<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Send out email to guests regarding wedding day attire <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Sent this out and included:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Wedding Day Attire info<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Important Dates: bachelor & bachelorette parties and wedding day timing<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">\u201cDon\u2019t forget to pack\u2026\u201d<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Info about Riviera Maya (Average temp in April and TimeZone)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Other important things to remember (travel insurance, vaccines\/shots, credit card, drinking the water in Mexico etc)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Reminder of our hashtag and our ID for the WedPics app<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Hair Trial <strong>\u2013 my girlfriend (also my hairdresser and is coming to the wedding) is coming over in a couple weeks when Col isn\u2019t home to try out my hair styles, we also dying my hair the Tuesday before we leave for Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Book eyelash extension appt<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><strike><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Continue tanning, started the week before my shower and starting again this week <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strike><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">\u2013 started tanning again, only once a week, I tend to get dark really fast<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:30pt\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Ties<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Added to Checklist:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Groom\u2019s Gift - I want to do something special for Colin on our day and have something delivered to him, like a message with a gift or something but I haven\u2019t figured out what yet<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Centrepieces \u2013 while we were going to just figure out vases and use the aisle flowers, we decided to take it into our own hands and I am so glad we did!\u00a0 We will now use my bouquet included in the package, split into 6 smaller bunches and used only in the aisles.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">I wish I could take credit but these premade bunches were at Michael\u2019s and I fell in love, and took advantage of the 40% of floral sale plus 20% off the entire purchase coupon.\u00a0 I found these adorable heart shaped vases at Michael\u2019s as well.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911882]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-50606600-1458004651.jpg\" title=\"Centrepiece Light.JPG -  127.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-50606600-1458004651.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Centrepiece Light.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911882]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-93653900-1458004668.jpg\" title=\"Centrepiece Black.JPG -  100.85KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-93653900-1458004668.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Centrepiece Black.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I completely forgot to post my shoes for the reception months and months ago. \u00a0They are nothing fancy, but comfy, cute and were $15 at payless. \u00a0I love that they have a strap at the back so I don't have to risk them falling off, and they will be hidden under my dress anyway.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911882]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-55081000-1458004904.jpg\" title=\"Reception Shoes.JPG -  86.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-55081000-1458004904.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Reception Shoes.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also completely forgot that I bought these in September (was possibly going to use them for my shower). \u00a0They are the cutest little bottles of bubbles from Party City. \u00a0I bought 2 boxes (12 in each) and am thinking about either putting them on a random chairs for the ceremony or a few bottles on each table at the reception. \u00a0They are about the size of my finger:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911882]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-27749800-1458005944.jpg\" title=\"Bubbles.JPG -  120.63KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281751-0-27749800-1458005944.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Bubbles.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As I was typing another one of Colin's friend's and girlfriend booked. \u00a0That brings us to 51 people - 49 adults (including Colin and I) and 2 children.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m sure I\u2019m forgetting something but that\u2019s all I can think of for now\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 My bullets are all off the and OCD in me hates that I can't get them lined up lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0428b491f49e7bd0531665285c23bc1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"] Everything is coming together and looks great! So excited for you&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911886,"PostDate":1458010640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> Everything is coming together and looks great! So excited for you\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417453045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.141.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1458010736,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdbd4016938e652180dac67aae5d2c27","RawContent":"Thank you @[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"]!  I&#039;m so excited for youuu!! So close!\n\n\nOpps, forgot to remove my best friend&#039;s jerk ex-fianc\u00e9. We are at 50 people (including Col, I and the two kiddies attending).\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1911887,"PostDate":1458010694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a>!  I'm so excited for youuu!! So close!<br><br>\nOpps, forgot to remove my best friend's jerk ex-fianc\u00e9. We are at 50 people (including Col, I and the two kiddies attending).<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"778b02a0becc6c0eef0e5805b42b7bd9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;And I forgot to comment on what a jerk-face your best friend&#039;s ex-fiance is. Jerk-face. Seriously. What is wrong with people?!? Who does that?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911888,"PostDate":1458011556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>And I forgot to comment on what a jerk-face your best friend's ex-fiance is. Jerk-face. Seriously. What is wrong with people?!? Who does that?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417453045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.66.68.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5727800f27ffd55f914219f8a44469d","RawContent":"I agree ... And jerk face is an understatement. Please tell me this &#039;girl&#039; dumped his a$$. This happened to my friend - not before their wedding but she was pregnant with their 3rd child. Douche city ladies!! Omg I feel so bad for her. Like wtf??\n\n\nEverything is coming along great :) and love the items you posted. Those sandals are perfect and you can wear them later. \n\n\nSorry did you say you may not have a guestbook at all?\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1911889,"PostDate":1458012563,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree ... And jerk face is an understatement. Please tell me this 'girl' dumped his a$$. This happened to my friend - not before their wedding but she was pregnant with their 3rd child. Douche city ladies!! Omg I feel so bad for her. Like wtf??<br><br>\nEverything is coming along great <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and love the items you posted. Those sandals are perfect and you can wear them later. <br><br>\nSorry did you say you may not have a guestbook at all?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.26.160.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59d6a6f3f61f0a89ed049c3551f12537","RawContent":"@[member=\"deecol\"] Sorry about what happened to your friend and that it is distracting from your wedding planning. I absolutely love the heart vases!! Your sandals are cute, mine are pretty similar.","Attachments":[],"Id":1911893,"PostDate":1458017741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertr