 <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ok....let's see if i actually posted this pic! we found these candle holders at ikea on sale. and we added aqua color rocks to complement our theme colors. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i213.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc50\/gracefulsteph\/August2007006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>[\/IMG]\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;6\/st\/20080516\/e\/our+wedding%21\/k\/1d17\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1d17\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"graceful_steph@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1183228279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207503.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":95,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gracefulsteph","Id":207503,"Name":"gracefulsteph","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fefebe886a666a24a731d1772e9b00a","RawContent":"Janet your centerpiece has always been my favorite...love the colors and everything about it :o)\n \n I didn&#039;t do traditional centerpieces, just candles and petals. At the head table for 2 there is a square vase with calla lilles and ribbon but I didn&#039;t ask for that, the WC did that on her own. Here&#039;s a sample of the simple set up we had:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i240.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff74\/itisisayitsme\/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i240.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff74\/itisisayitsme\/8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":106577,"PostDate":1189225343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Janet your centerpiece has always been my favorite...love the colors and everything about it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<br \/> <br \/> I didn't do traditional centerpieces, just candles and petals. At the head table for 2 there is a square vase with calla lilles and ribbon but I didn't ask for that, the WC did that on her own. Here's a sample of the simple set up we had:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i240.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff74\/itisisayitsme\/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i240.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff74\/itisisayitsme\/8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168274640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1c9995992d5f9aa74998cd25116cbba","RawContent":"here are mine\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b7d624b3127cceb89140d807b600000025100Abt2zdw3btmKg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b7d624b3127cceb8913079861f00000026100Abt2zdw3btmKg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":107017,"PostDate":1189369201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                here are mine<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b7d624b3127cceb89140d807b600000025100Abt2zdw3btmKg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b7d624b3127cceb8913079861f00000026100Abt2zdw3btmKg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161396480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85dc2ab32fbfabf538bec6b207d1970f","RawContent":"Working on an idea using Blumebuds... &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i191.photobucket.com\/albums\/z231\/Hopels616\/Blumebud.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n We are almost 100% using 1 long table. We&#039;re thinking about using these as combination decoration\/placecard, aqua with a single red flower. The table will also have flower petals and probably some small votives (similar to Jamy&#039;s). What do you guys think?\n \n We had been planning to do small glass vials with everyone&#039;s name as a placecard, but this will be so-oo much lighter to take with us!","Attachments":[],"Id":109867,"PostDate":1189821683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Working on an idea using Blumebuds... <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i191.photobucket.com\/albums\/z231\/Hopels616\/Blumebud.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We are almost 100% using 1 long table. We're thinking about using these as combination decoration\/placecard, aqua with a single red flower. The table will also have flower petals and probably some small votives (similar to Jamy's). What do you guys think?<br \/> <br \/> We had been planning to do small glass vials with everyone's name as a placecard, but this will be so-oo much lighter to take with us!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i191.photobucket.com\/albums\/z231\/Hopels616\/c38764af.jpg\">http:\/\/i191.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...6\/c38764af.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/lb1f.lilypie.com\/BF1lm5.png\">http:\/\/lb1f.lilypie.com\/BF1lm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hopels@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1185448428,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207564.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenn","Id":207564,"Name":"Jenn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignat