{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89c309c3e98fca19535c94bf7cdd05f1","RawContent":"we used rascal flatts, bless the broken road because that song is special to us. \n \n I walked down the aisle to Somewhere over the rainbow.","Attachments":[],"Id":144397,"PostDate":1196203139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we used rascal flatts, bless the broken road because that song is special to us. <br \/> <br \/> I walked down the aisle to Somewhere over the rainbow.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jill@...","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1162187940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206877.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*JillD*","Id":206877,"Name":"*JillD*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f699d815b006225a7dec7c397c8c32b","RawContent":"We PLAN to do a choreographed dance to Jack Johnson&#039;s Better Together and then transition to Michael Jackson&#039;s The Way You Make Me Feel. Our inspiration is this youtube video:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/watch?v=3nie9lKPifg\"&gt;YouTube - Wedding first dance w\/ surprise Jack Johnson Michael Jackson&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n We thought it would be hilarious and get people pumped to dance. I hope we don&#039;t chicken out.","Attachments":[],"Id":144404,"PostDate":1196203850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We PLAN to do a choreographed dance to Jack Johnson's Better Together and then transition to Michael Jackson's The Way You Make Me Feel. Our inspiration is this youtube video:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/youtube.com\/watch?v=3nie9lKPifg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>YouTube - Wedding first dance w\/ surprise Jack Johnson Michael Jackson<\/a><br \/> <br \/> We thought it would be hilarious and get people pumped to dance. I hope we don't chicken out.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i113.photobucket.com\/albums\/n239\/lantonio1978\/JohnLeiasWeddingpropics406-1.jpg?t=1248795804\">http:\/\/i113.photobucket.com\/albums\/n...g?t=1248795804<\/a><span>Dreams Los CabosOctober 25, 2008<\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/leias-planning-thread-30817\/\">Leia's Planning Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/leias-dreams-los-cabos-review-31458\/\">Leia's Dreams Los Cabos Review<\/a><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/s\/dreams\/2008\/october\/leia2\/index.html\">Our Wedding Slideshow<\/a><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/s\/dreams\/2008\/october\/leia\/index.html\">Our Engagement Slideshow<\/a><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=gelvkrySKaw\">Our Wedding Video<\/a><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ycwSTNzJJ6c\">Our Wedding Slideshow...on youtube<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Lantonio@rnmail.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1189841460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207736.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Leia78","Id":207736,"Name":"Leia78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba36e0196d1684a8b49591018bab12aa","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;DRbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Wanted to see what you girls plan to use as your first dance song. I have been looking and looking but no luck yet. I really like that new Alicia Keys song, &amp;quot;No One&amp;quot; but that&#039;s just a thought. I am in love with &amp;quot;Somewhere Over the Rainbow&amp;quot; by Israel Kamakawiwo but I don&#039;t know if its appropriate or not. I have to read into the lyrics more. If you haven&#039;t heard that song go onto youtube and check it out. Its so beautiful!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I walked down the aisle to &amp;quot;Somewhere over the Rainbow&amp;quot; by Isreal. It was the perfect beach song! Our first dance song was &amp;quot;I&#039;ll Stand by You&amp;quot; by Carrie Underwood.","Attachments":[],"Id":144420,"PostDate":1196207898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>DRbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Wanted to see what you girls plan to use as your first dance song. I have been looking and looking but no luck yet. I really like that new Alicia Keys song, \"No One\" but that's just a thought. I am in love with \"Somewhere Over the Rainbow\" by Israel Kamakawiwo but I don't know if its appropriate or not. I have to read into the lyrics more. If you haven't heard that song go onto youtube and check it out. Its so beautiful!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I walked down the aisle to \"Somewhere over the Rainbow\" by Isreal. It was the perfect beach song! Our first dance song was \"I'll Stand by You\" by Carrie Underwood.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisa.gatzke@rbccm.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1166050860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaG","Id":206967,"Name":"LisaG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d46f67b7893799258b1b4903b0a6638b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Leia78&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We PLAN to do a choreographed dance to Jack Johnson&#039;s Better Together and then transition to Michael Jackson&#039;s The Way You Make Me Feel. Our inspiration is this youtube video:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/watch?v=3nie9lKPifg\"&gt;YouTube - Wedding first dance w\/ surprise Jack Johnson Michael Jackson&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n We thought it would be hilarious and get people pumped to dance. I hope we don&#039;t chicken out.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That&#039;s awesome! We LOVE Jack Johnson, and we have a friend that plays guitar and wanted him to play an accoustical version of that sometime during the ceremony - but sadly he can&#039;t make it.\n \n Micah and I have always wanted our first dance to be to &amp;quot;These are the Days&amp;quot; by Van Morrison. We may not even do dancing though for our DW - which makes me sad now that I think about it.","Attachments":[],"Id":144461,"PostDate":1196213964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Leia78<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We PLAN to do a choreographed dance to Jack Johnson's Better Together and then transition to Michael Jackson's The Way You Make Me Feel. Our inspiration is this youtube video:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/youtube.com\/watch?v=3nie9lKPifg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>YouTube - Wedding first dance w\/ surprise Jack Johnson Michael Jackson<\/a><br \/> <br \/> We thought it would be hilarious and get people pumped to dance. I hope we don't chicken out.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That's awesome! We LOVE Jack Johnson, and we have a friend that plays guitar and wanted him to play an accoustical version of that sometime during the ceremony - but sadly he can't make it.<br \/> <br \/> Micah and I have always wanted our first dance to be to \"These are the Days\" by Van Morrison. We may not even do dancing though for our DW - which makes me sad now that I think about it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t26269\">My Review<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t27035\">Random EDR Pics<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t28653\">Pro Pics<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t24302\">Planning Pics<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;24\/st\/20080724\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/5980\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5980\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rmaez1@lsu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1195631922,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nolaroy724","Id":207967,"Name":"nolaroy724","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7795cf791dc6c1f97348ef6c2bc14637","RawContent":"Ours is going to be &amp;quot;Then you can tell me goodbye&amp;quot; sung by Neal McCoy. The lyrics are pretty.","Attachments":[],"Id":144463,"PostDate":1196213984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ours is going to be \"Then you can tell me goodbye\" sung by Neal McCoy. The lyrics are pretty.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i236.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff278\/CarrieRN_album\/IMG_1472.jpg\">http:\/\/i236.photobucket.com\/albums\/f...m\/IMG_1472.jpg<\/a><br><span>Philip at 1 yr old. Go Steelers!<\/span><br><span>Soon I will get to post wedding pics, figure I should get some more Philip in first!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/Mvdhm5\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/Mvdhm5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"carriehannan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1193748474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207888.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CarrieRN","Id":207888,"Name":"CarrieRN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2780d89ace58a7c378182e1f18c34438","RawContent":"A Wink and A Smile by Harry Connick Jr.\n Our parents dance was That&#039;s How Strong my Love Is by Otis Redding (and there is also a Rolling Stones version)","Attachments":[],"Id":144465,"PostDate":1196214171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                A Wink and A Smile by Harry Connick Jr.<br \/> Our parents dance was That's How Strong my Love Is by Otis Redding (and there is also a Rolling Stones version)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Bridget and Brian<\/span><br><span>Los Cabos 11\/17\/07<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bkneumann@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1174381228,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207269.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fogdog","Id":207269,"Name":"fogdog","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ee0b8e845a6efcda412cc114c754b26","RawContent":"We had a really really hard time with this and finally decided on Into the Mystic by Van Morrison. We were happy with our choice.","Attachments":[],"Id":144467,"PostDate":1196214844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We had a really really hard time with this and finally decided on Into the Mystic by Van Morrison. We were happy with our choice.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"graberjul@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.33.230.91","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1168126500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207027.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":283,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JulieG","Id":207027,"Name":"JulieG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f734af1785dbe582a8f3bdbd125b7397","RawContent":"Oops double post.","Attachments":[],"Id":144469,"PostDate":1196214932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oops double post.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"graberjul@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.33.230.91","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1168126500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207027.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":283,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JulieG","Id":207027,"Name":"JulieG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc3d1a7548102942850af058ce52006a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Leia78&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We PLAN to do a choreographed dance to Jack Johnson&#039;s Better Together and then transition to Michael Jackson&#039;s The Way You Make Me Feel. Our inspiration is this youtube video:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/watch?v=3nie9lKPifg\"&gt;YouTube - Wedding first dance w\/ surprise Jack Johnson Michael Jackson&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n We thought it would be hilarious and get people pumped to dance. I hope we don&#039;t chicken out.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That video was great. Definitely sets a fun tone. I could only get my FI to do it if he had a decent amount of alcohol in his system.","Attachments":[],"Id":144471,"PostDate":1196215049,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Leia78<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We PLAN to do a choreographed dance to Jack Johnson's Better Together and then transition to Michael Jackson's The Way You Make Me Feel. Our inspiration is this youtube video:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/youtube.com\/watch?v=3nie9lKPifg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>YouTube - Wedding first dance w\/ surprise Jack Johnson Michael Jackson<\/a><br \/> <br \/> We thought it would be hilarious and get people pumped to dance. I hope we don't chicken out.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That video was great. Definitely sets a fun tone. I could only get my FI to do it if he had a decent amount of alcohol in his system.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i236.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff278\/CarrieRN_album\/IMG_1472.jpg\">http:\/\/i236.photobucket.com\/albums\/f...m\/IMG_1472.jpg<\/a><br><span>Philip at 1 yr old. Go Steelers!<\/span><br><span>Soon I will get to post wedding pics, figure I should get some more Philip in first!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/Mvdhm5\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/Mvdhm5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"carriehannan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1193748474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207888.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CarrieRN","Id":207888,"Name":"CarrieRN","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3abd824feb77a24484d60147c031c2f3","RawContent":"I think we are going with Making Memories of Us by Keith Urban. I;m am going to listen to all these you guys have posted as most of &#039;em are not familiar to me &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/blush2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Blush2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":144532,"PostDate":1196223372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think we are going with Making Memories of Us by Keith Urban. I;m am going to listen to all these you guys have posted as most of 'em are not familiar to me <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/blush2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Blush2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"corinahenstridge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1189979099,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207745.gif?