e='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maria1488<\/span><\/a> I ordered my table runners from Chair cover factory. If you google them they are easy to find and they always have really fair rates and the quality is pretty good too. When I looked on Etsy they were all very overpriced.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d757811ff60aad2fb9289d2b5bc77a14","RawContent":"@[member=\"deecol\"] awesome find! I get intimidated at Michaels. You ladies walk around finding deals and inspiration, I just get so overwhelmed. I can&#039;t wait to see your flowers all together","Attachments":[],"Id":1904993,"PostDate":1442594159,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> awesome find! I get intimidated at Michaels. You ladies walk around finding deals and inspiration, I just get so overwhelmed. I can't wait to see your flowers all together\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d21bb226c8b58228cfc41a894904534","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;My Recent Michael&#039;s Finds and Some More Planning&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridesmaid Dresses:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks to @nkavanaugh&amp;nbsp;I purchased my Bridesmaid&#039;s dresses from Lulu&#039;s. &amp;nbsp;They are the Royal Engagement Dresses in Coral Pink, after taxes, shipping and the US exchange rate I got each dress for $110 CDN. I covered the cost as part of their bridesmaids gift.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My sister is really fair skinned, and my best friend is Southern Italian, the colour of this dress suits both of their skin tones perfectly. &amp;nbsp;This is the medium, both Melissa and I are 5&#039;7. &amp;nbsp;They were bit long so the girls will need to get them hemmed. &amp;nbsp;The bust is supportive (no bra worn in this photo), the waist and butt area has lots of room, the waist is a bit tight and doesn&#039;t have much give. &amp;nbsp;Maybe I&#039;m baised but if I was a bridesmaid in a beach wedding I would totally want to wear these, which made me super excited for my girls. &amp;nbsp;This is me trying on the dress:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve asked them to wear flat, silver sandals for the reception, they can choose whatever they like as long as they show me first. Neither of them are huge chunky jewellery people so that will be kept to a minimum as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;My Hair:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At first I pictured my hair down, curled and a flower (hence the flower in my picture with my dress). &amp;nbsp;Then I tried on the veil, and then my best friend sent me this and it was so me:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I often throw my hair up in a bun and I love the simplicity of the look. &amp;nbsp;My dress is pretty busy at the bottom and the top is open, so my hair being in that big beautiful bun and with the veil I think it would be perfect. &amp;nbsp;Plus I don&#039;t have to really think about it during the day.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My girlfriend who does my hair regularly is coming to the wedding, she will be doing my hair for the day, along with my bridesmaids and Mom.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am also doing my own make-up - I have always hated getting it done and I&#039;m quite good with that sort of stuff.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recent Michael&#039;s Finds:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Although I need to check on a couple items with the resort for decor, I started picking up a few things:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Silver Frames @ $3 each to place on the front table (if there is a front table - TBC) with either pictures of Col &amp;amp; I or some sort of signage.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Letter Initials @ .25 cents each that&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"perianjay\"] suggested I spray paint silver and place on the front table that I&#039;m hoping exists. &amp;nbsp;If it doesn&#039;t, I will keep black and use in my home. &amp;nbsp;Couldn&#039;t lose at that price.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As mentioned, I&#039;m making my own bouquet. &amp;nbsp;I picked up these gorgeous roses @ $4 each:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And started working them in:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I need to work on the arrangement and may add a few more small, closed, pink roses.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Coming up:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Colin has asked his brother and cousin in London to go and be measured this weekend. &amp;nbsp;This week and weekend we&#039;ll be looking into some options, hoping to have this sorted within a month&#039;s time&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Downloading the wedding music app this weekend and start loading reception songs&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;We are planning on sending out a final email to the guests that have not booked in the beginning of November to make them aware of the RSVP date&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905196,"PostDate":1442945711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><u>My Recent Michael's Finds and Some More Planning<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridesmaid Dresses:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks to @nkavanaugh\u00a0I purchased my Bridesmaid's dresses from Lulu's. \u00a0They are the Royal Engagement Dresses in Coral Pink, after taxes, shipping and the US exchange rate I got each dress for $110 CDN. I covered the cost as part of their bridesmaids gift.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My sister is really fair skinned, and my best friend is Southern Italian, the colour of this dress suits both of their skin tones perfectly. \u00a0This is the medium, both Melissa and I are 5'7. \u00a0They were bit long so the girls will need to get them hemmed. \u00a0The bust is supportive (no bra worn in this photo), the waist and butt area has lots of room, the waist is a bit tight and doesn't have much give. \u00a0Maybe I'm baised but if I was a bridesmaid in a beach wedding I would totally want to wear these, which made me super excited for my girls. \u00a0This is me trying on the dress:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-94657400-1442940346.jpg\" title=\"Bridesmaids dressses - cropped.jpg -  46.22KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-94657400-1442940346.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Bridesmaids dressses - cropped.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've asked them to wear flat, silver sandals for the reception, they can choose whatever they like as long as they show me first. Neither of them are huge chunky jewellery people so that will be kept to a minimum as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>My Hair:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At first I pictured my hair down, curled and a flower (hence the flower in my picture with my dress). \u00a0Then I tried on the veil, and then my best friend sent me this and it was so me:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-71963400-1442940653.jpg\" title=\"Hilary duff wedding hair front.jpg -  23.7KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-71963400-1442940653.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Hilary duff wedding hair front.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-47149000-1442940667.jpg\" title=\"hilary-duff-wedding-hair-8xezhho4x.jpg -  25.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-47149000-1442940667.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"hilary-duff-wedding-hair-8xezhho4x.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I often throw my hair up in a bun and I love the simplicity of the look. \u00a0My dress is pretty busy at the bottom and the top is open, so my hair being in that big beautiful bun and with the veil I think it would be perfect. \u00a0Plus I don't have to really think about it during the day.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My girlfriend who does my hair regularly is coming to the wedding, she will be doing my hair for the day, along with my bridesmaids and Mom.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also doing my own make-up - I have always hated getting it done and I'm quite good with that sort of stuff.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Recent Michael's Finds:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Although I need to check on a couple items with the resort for decor, I started picking up a few things:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Silver Frames @ $3 each to place on the front table (if there is a front table - TBC) with either pictures of Col & I or some sort of signage.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-97956100-1442941274.jpg\" title=\"Silver Frames.JPG -  152.09KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-97956100-1442941274.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Silver Frames.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Letter Initials @ .25 cents each that\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> suggested I spray paint silver and place on the front table that I'm hoping exists. \u00a0If it doesn't, I will keep black and use in my home. \u00a0Couldn't lose at that price.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-43247400-1442941494.jpg\" title=\"Letters.JPG -  110.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-43247400-1442941494.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Letters.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As mentioned, I'm making my own bouquet. \u00a0I picked up these gorgeous roses @ $4 each:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-02290400-1442941540.jpg\" title=\"Pink Roses for Bouquet.JPG -  108.98KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-02290400-1442941540.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Pink Roses for Bouquet.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And started working them in:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905196]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-78799700-1442941574.jpg\" title=\"Bouquet - Stage 2.JPG -  95.71KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281751-0-78799700-1442941574.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Bouquet - Stage 2.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I need to work on the arrangement and may add a few more small, closed, pink roses.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Coming up:<\/p>\n<ul><li>Colin has asked his brother and cousin in London to go and be measured this weekend. \u00a0This week and weekend we'll be looking into some options, hoping to have this sorted within a month's time<\/li>\n<li>Downloading the wedding music app this weekend and start loading reception songs<\/li>\n<li>We are planning on sending out a final email to the guests that have not booked in the beginning of November to make them aware of the RSVP date<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f886b43436b22e2ad034db735be93ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Beautiful!!! That dress is gorgeous and I love it. I still wish I went with a dress like that for my ladies because the one person who was dying for us to get convertible dresses is now no longer in my bridal party haha.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think for the bouquet you could maybe even add a few pieces of greenery? It would probably really pull it all together. I love the florals they are super nice. I&#039;m thinking of adding a few of these to my bouquet. I bought them at michaels for a pretty decent price and I was going to add some to my centrepieces and my bride&#039;s bouquet..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think it&#039;s called lambs ear.. the name of this particular leave. The ones I bought are pretty similar. They are a light fuzzy green.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Not sure if this is something you&#039;re open to or even wanted, but thought i&#039;d let you know :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905199,"PostDate":1442946650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Beautiful!!! That dress is gorgeous and I love it. I still wish I went with a dress like that for my ladies because the one person who was dying for us to get convertible dresses is now no longer in my bridal party haha.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think for the bouquet you could maybe even add a few pieces of greenery? It would probably really pull it all together. I love the florals they are super nice. I'm thinking of adding a few of these to my bouquet. I bought them at michaels for a pretty decent price and I was going to add some to my centrepieces and my bride's bouquet..<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905199]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281478-0-23411500-1442942984.jpg\" title=\"3243.jpg -  90.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281478-0-23411500-1442942984.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"3243.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905199]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281478-0-96261100-1442942995.png\" title=\"peach-peonies-lambs-ear-bridal-bridesmaid-bouquets.original.png -  1000.46KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-281478-0-96261100-1442942995.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"peach-peonies-lambs-ear-bridal-bridesmaid-bouquets.original.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think it's called lambs ear.. the name of this particular leave. The ones I bought are pretty similar. They are a light fuzzy green.<\/p>\n<p>Not sure if this is something you're open to or even wanted, but thought i'd let you know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1442946743,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3906b756fcebe4ba874c2a122bf84f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] That&#039;s a great idea, thanks! &amp;nbsp;I haven&#039;t thought about adding greenery before!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905200,"PostDate":1442946729,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> That's a great idea, thanks! \u00a0I haven't thought about adding greenery before!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421446169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.245.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85fe31d1b7c253d0c424773ee4912e9b","RawContent":"Love those dresses. If they had been mentioned before my wedding I would have looked into them too, if they have a short version :)\n\n\nI think if you want a table at the entrance they&#039;d do that for you :)\n\n\nGreat finds!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1905204,"PostDate":1442948694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love those dresses. If they had been mentioned before my wedding I would have looked into them too, if they have a short version <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI think if you want a table at the entrance they'd do that for you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nGreat finds!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59221943779ec20867a4c119e2f79219","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] For sure - I just need to sort out the particulars.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve been lucking out at Michael&#039;s lately, even picked up some stuff for the best friend&#039;s bachelorette.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905205,"PostDate":1442948818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigge